sequenceDiagram
    actor Learner
    participant PWA as PWA Client (Browser)
    participant Auth as Express /api/auth/register
    participant AI as AIContentGenerator Service
    participant GPT as OpenAI GPT-4o API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Engine as AdaptiveEngine (shared module)

    Learner->>PWA: Submit registration form (email, password, subject, diagnostic score)
    PWA->>Auth: POST /api/auth/register
    Auth->>AI: generateModulesForSubject(subject)
    AI->>GPT: POST /v1/chat/completions (structured prompt, Sec. 3.7.6)
    GPT-->>AI: 9 modules (3 per proficiency tier)
    AI-->>Auth: parsed and validated module array
    Auth->>DB: insertMany(ContentModule documents)
    Auth->>Auth: bcrypt.hash(password)
    Auth->>DB: create(User)
    Auth->>Engine: initialiseLearnerProfile(userId, diagnosticScore, subject)
    Engine-->>Auth: proficiencyLevel and currentPath
    Auth->>DB: create(LearnerProfile)
    Auth->>Auth: signToken(user)
    Auth-->>PWA: Set-Cookie (httpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict) + profile JSON
    PWA->>PWA: mirror profile into localStorage (offline-first copy)
    PWA-->>Learner: Render personalised learning path
